---
description: Prevent exporting server-callable helpers from "use client" modules (RSC boundary)
globs: app/**/*.tsx,features/**/*.tsx,components/**/*.tsx,lib/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# RSC client/server boundary

Never export pure helpers from a `"use client"` file and import them into a Server Component (e.g. `app/**/page.tsx`).

- Pure helpers/types → `lib/` (no `"use client"`)
- Interactive UI → `"use client"` feature/component
- Server pages may **render** client components and pass serializable props; they must **not call** functions from client modules

See `docs/nextjs-rsc-boundaries.md`.
